{
  "_name": "t88_channel_storm_breadth",
  "_desc": "Propagation-breadth gate for the channel gossip plane under the MESHROUTE engine. s13 pull-storm (hub posts 1 channel msg at 60s; 11 pull nodes gossip it via digest->pull->M-broadcast->overhear). Closes the blind spot where s13 exited 0 with coverage=1: asserts the hub self-originates AND all 11 pull nodes emit channel_msg_received (full propagation). Regression guard for the M-broadcast on_handed gap fix (DATA anchored to actual RTS TX) \u2014 a desync collapses coverage to 1 and fails here.",
